\ vectored-loop.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 8
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch08/vectored-loop.8th
\
\ Factoring the one differing step out of an otherwise identical loop
\ body, by deferring just that step -- Brodie's DUMP/CDUMP example,
\ translated.

defer: show-item   \ n --

: show-plain    \ n --
  . cr ;

: show-tagged   \ n --
  "item: %d\n" s:strfmt . ;

: dump-list   \ arr --
  ( swap drop show-item ) a:each drop ;

' show-plain w:is show-item
[ 1 , 2 , 3 ] dump-list

' show-tagged w:is show-item
[ 1 , 2 , 3 ] dump-list

bye
